During the reign of the [[Galactic Empire]], [[White Worms]] [[scrumrat]] [[Rebolt]] possessed the [[Commander of Staves (staff)|Commander of Staves]], a staff of his own making which he wrapped with [[Color|black]] rycrit leather for insulation.<ref name="SOG">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]''</ref>

